      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To generate an embedding vector for a text string, I need to use a concrete external provider. I will use the Amazon Bedrock service for this task, as it provides a variety of pre-trained models for generating embeddings. I will import the necessary modules from the Amazon Bedrock SDK and use a specific model identifier to make the provider identifiable in the code. </thinking>\n",
